# spikee workspace. `spikee init` copies its own scaffolding here (seeds,
# datasets, plugins, judges, providers, attacks) and `generate`/`test` write
# datasets and results. None of that is ours to version — only the two custom
# target adapters are. Ignore everything, then whitelist just those.
/*
!.gitignore
!targets/
targets/*
!targets/securerag_query.py
!targets/securerag_rag.py
